OL,3,GSouth West
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FClear spells
OL,6,Fgive way to an organised band of
OL,7,Fblustery showers pushing in from the
OL,8,Fwest overnight. These will likely be
OL,9,Fheavy at times with the odd rumble of
OL,10,Fthunder possible before mostly
OL,11,Fclearing by dawn with winds falling
OL,12,Flight.
OL,13,
OL,14,CThursday:FA dry start with sunny
OL,15,Fspells before Storm Austen pushes in
OL,16,Ffrom the southwest during the
OL,17,Fafternoon. This brings wet and windy
OL,18,Fweather, reaching gale force at coasts
OL,19,Fovernight.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
