OL,3,GSouth West
OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Friday to Sunday:FStorm
OL,6,FAusten continues affecting the region
OL,7,Ffor most of Friday, clearing to
OL,8,Fisolated showers by evening. Further
OL,9,Fheavy rain and wind likely Saturday
OL,10,Fahead of a drier interlude on Sunday.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
